  "prefLabel": "Plc 1202.12 Personal contact information",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1202.12 “Personal contact information” means an individual’s home or other personal telephone number, home address, home mailing address if different, and designated email address.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 1200) #13704, eff 8-1-23",
